+\centering\small
+\caption[Independent multi-trigger validation]{Observed peak validation ASR (percent).
+The completed-round columns expose stopped histories. Peaks use available
+endpoints only; an absent endpoint is not imputed. Clean loss is the largest
+paired clean macro-F1 decrease, in percentage points.}
+\label{tab:revision-independent-validation}
+\begin{tabular}{llrrrrrr}
